{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"616b0e33a33d7d37e8e68f68e0fe41c99e37883d97831ec4454d55acb1c5ba72","ja":"ミス・Wの真意","zh":"W小姐的真实意图","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e22be6be7d5269e2acc5486ab286beac804e8e7678b65b6c5cd5827fb7c8f6e8","ja":"「うふふっ……。みなさん、よくここまで\nたどり着きました。さすが『月兎隊』です」","zh":"「呜呼呼……。大家，真亏你们能走到这里\n。不愧是『月兔队』。」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"43ed0e83f77d7c4a3dbc3db6c770286eeb679518ba89f4021851a48a33fecad3","ja":"「あら？　隊長として、これくらいの謎は\r\n解けて当然だわ！」","zh":"「哎呀？　作为队长，这种程度的谜题\n当然解得开啦！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"74f92bccfc60417c18f7d123eec23273b227198dca5a2c458a4ca55e495a56b0","ja":"……って、どうして役になりきって話してるのよ。","zh":"……不是，你怎么完全进入角色在说话啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"31910f4a49a1374aa8cb9712123e0bc74f34cf74b96871f84db7f27b33ef3c80","ja":"なるほど～。カードの表には『765』の文字、\r\nその裏には宝箱の絵が描いてありました～。","zh":"原来如此～。卡片的正面写着『765』的文字，\n背面画着宝箱的图画～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f13408a63f99c154c0a0386011c31f58a3ff17c8467cc7df1d7c292a8fe01772","ja":"つまり、『宝が示す場所』というのは、765の\n裏側……屋上の看板裏のことだったんですね～。","zh":"也就是说，\"宝物指示的地方\"指的是765的\n背面……也就是屋顶招牌后面的意思吧～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"761b8c75f7676323845f930e3715ef7bab797f2ddb630dd2f5f4e248f0e36082","ja":"とうちゃ～く♪　……あっ、みんなもうそろってる！\nせっかく謎を解いたのに、負けちゃった～……。","zh":"到啦～♪　……啊，大家都已经到齐了！\n好不容易解开了谜题，却输了～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b5eedcc91c824ef3c4e6aad206756d4c3877a8e81e069315b604e475af98b9fe","ja":"未来さん、謎を解いたのは\n桃子だってこと、忘れないでね。","zh":"未来小姐，解开谜题的是\n桃子，别忘了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2deb7296879d5bcbf5de939c3ecb6548cce17faacd9ad73944b707e0765fbfb0","ja":"もちろんだよ～、さすが桃子ちゃん！　でも歌織さん、\nどうして謎解きでみんなを呼んだんですか？","zh":"当然啦～，真不愧是桃子！但是歌织，\n为什么用解谜把大家叫来了呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"e310a7487f2c9d24a0fc5e05f20b3c010b6a624cd7ca92675ff352ac32918953","ja":"それはね……今夜は月がきれいだから、\nみんなでお月見をしようって思ったの♪","zh":"那是因为……今晚月色很美，\n所以我想和大家一起赏月♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"020c8249238e569210273e0077635a292dbc47db8eebd98a2d7d78cc3569711c","ja":"せっかくこのメンバーで、この衣装でしょう？\nなにか趣向を凝らしたいなって思って♪","zh":"难得是这个阵容、这套服装，对吧？\n我就想弄出点什么新花样♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"de41eca741438a17d3d8a82ad699ed9559cabeb5f46c521e274358f4b705452e","ja":"それで謎を用意したんですね～？\n秘密のミッションみたいで、楽しかったですよ～。","zh":"原来你准备了谜题啊～？\n就像秘密任务一样，很开心哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_935.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"f35140e3e2e5d746a7d1dfcaa669a9cad47fed161d4968f9047ad3f4b8a19829","ja":"なかなか粋なことするじゃない。それじゃあ……\n本物の月の兎の様子でも、眺めることにしましょうか♪","zh":"还挺有格调的。那么……\n就来看看真正的月兔是什么模样吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
